of \\\"Spider-Man\\\" movies, from the Sam Raimi trilogy to Marc Webb's movies and the trio from Jon Watts.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":301959,\"title\":\"Interstellar: Nolan's Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i4PpBcuLvdcJwIf3hkcV9QDR1iH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the lens of Christopher Nolan's space epic.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":524288,\"title\":\"Period. End of Sentence.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dsCeBj8oabzsHQOGGLPrmrqIvDs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9uW5X9fdtfJp0bSW60Eqh0lqcEt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an effort to improve feminine hygiene, a machine that creates low-cost biodegradable sanitary pads is installed in a rural village in Northern India. Using the machine, a group of local women is employed to produce and sell pads, offering them newfound independence and helping to destigmatize menstruation for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":569499,\"title\":\"Detainment\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yYicmaYHOwDsdqwnoQLibL4eHjW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hdkdmyFeg9he75bu1z6r5iJlMQd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two ten year-old boys are detained by police under suspicion of abducting and murdering a toddler.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":477331,\"title\":\"Long Shot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8LDeHrG8RBluJ7IkPgBaOMkU3fl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o1gNOkgyQhsdK0x6FcpoV7TR35C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Juan Catalan is arrested for a murder he insists he didn't commit, he builds his case for innocence around unexpected raw footage.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":416211,\"title\":\"The White Helmets\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w5wJW2MrmhoZYSrCzaB8WxkYDEC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hkbzt4YyjrduGqeN9kHEdXMCEQm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As daily airstrikes pound civilian targets in Syria, a group of indomitable first responders risk their lives to rescue victims from the rubble.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21744,\"title\":\"Ocean Men, Extreme Dive\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ptl45UZ0IXHDYDMn81oSfVOcjKf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6ODELroa9xBnP9uTQIi9e2lmH2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For more than 10 years, world champion freedivers Pipin Ferreras and Umberto Pelizzari have been vying for world records. Their love of the sea without compromise is what unites these two rivals. However, it is their different personalities and opposing diving philosophies that separate them. Pipin is the \\\"No Limits\\\" man who wants to go deeper and deeper. Umberto, the purist, seeks harmony in the ocean's depth. Ocean Men takes you into the world of these two awe-inspiring freedivers through the use of breathtaking underwater photography, enchanting music, and insightful animation.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":881320,\"title\":\"Un chico de portada: el arte de Macario Gómez\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hO0OdV0Ha5dJxkzztvjA0mk0xsI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uMpMaeDBdgKR9UgubVOVW4w0CRt.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macario 'Mac' Gómez talks about his long career as a film poster designer.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21739,\"title\":\"Great North\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r1cKHShkZvitzhbugVKQWvfKs4w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zD2rlkgPpIJ5Jp3WsH72AZlu2S4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This film takes viewers through the rich, white majesty of the Inuit Great North. Along with doing justice to the breathtaking and awesome landscape of the freezing, snow-covered environment, Great North also looks into the long-standing traditions, such as fishing and hunting, of the Inuit tribes.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476053,\"title\":\"Strawberries Will Save the World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hPXDe8z0vpYSS9C06ZjOpxLgec8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gfxKWNeovzFuFWkkdy917zFgnSM.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yuko Okumura is the biggest strawberry enthusiast living in Bloomington, Indiana. A member of an online community of strawberry lovers, she shares her strawberry collection and obsession with friends from around the world. Yuko has big plans to show the world the power that strawberries hold and happiness they can bring to humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1473993,\"title\":\"Romances\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cEykcow0MbVNf02k9HylrmjF1PM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The film, based on the artistic-documentary aesthetics, is about the fate of three sons of the Javanshir dynasty, who are connected to Karabakh and this corner of Azerbaijan - Mahammad bey Ashiq, who lived in the 18th century, Abdussamad bey Ashiq, who lived in the 19th century, and Khosrov bey Javanshir, who lived in the 20th century. These three personalities, influential poets and public figures of their time, were subjected to persecution and repression during the Russian and Soviet empires.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"57SQ9bDhxDY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":